            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUMANITY'S FUTURE WAS BUILT BY MACHINES.</h2><br>INTERSTELLAR PRIME is a science-fiction RPG in Early Access. Enter Remnant City as Silas Lane, a Robocor technician whose work draws him into a conspiracy surrounding artificial intelligence and humanity's future.<br><br>Humanity's largest Martian colony survives inside the shattered remains of Phobos and Deimos. Automated systems keep the city alive, but the society that depends on them is beginning to lose control.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE UNITY 6 STORY REBUILD IS NOW IN EARLY ACCESS</h2><br>The public Steam build has been updated to the Unity 6 Story Mode rebuild. Begin the rebuilt story, explore Remnant City, and experience spacecraft and robot-command sequences. This is an incomplete Early Access build, with bugs, rough edges, and unfinished content.<br><br><strong>Development continues. The current release is an early portion of the game, not the completed campaign.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LOOK AT THE UNITY 6 REBUILD</h2><br>The Unity 6 rebuild brings third-person exploration, spacecraft sequences, and RTS robot command into the same adventure. These screenshots were captured from development gameplay shortly before the September 2026 update. Details may differ from the current build, and visuals, interfaces, controls, performance, and content remain in development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras/5a7bf9394a109abf2ba431324f775885.avif?t=1790799403\" alt=\"Third-person exploration through the neon-lit streets of Remnant City. Unity 6 gameplay captured before the September 2026 update; details may differ from the current build.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras_big/5a7bf9394a109abf2ba431324f775885.avif?t=1790799403 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WALK THE STREETS OF REMNANT CITY</h2><br>The rebuild takes you through neon-lit streets, industrial walkways, and Robocor assignments. Meet the people who keep the colony running and follow their work into the machinery beneath everyday life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras/94786ccc36601ed710ff7aa550e981f4.avif?t=1790799403\" alt=\"Armored player aboard Poseidon with Flux controls and a targeted robot. Unity 6 gameplay captured before the September 2026 update; details may differ from the current build.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras_big/94786ccc36601ed710ff7aa550e981f4.avif?t=1790799403 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE CRISIS ABOARD POSEIDON</h2><br>The rebuilt opening moves through damaged ship corridors, robot encounters, and an emergency above Mars. The development footage shows the suit's Flux abilities, exterior traversal, and the Theseus control sequence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras/1ef6199e229001a41d775dca550bb999.avif?t=1790799403\" alt=\"Armored player outside a spacecraft with Mars filling the background. Unity 6 gameplay captured before the September 2026 update; details may differ from the current build.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras_big/1ef6199e229001a41d775dca550bb999.avif?t=1790799403 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE COMMAND OF THE MACHINES</h2><br>Switch from the street-level perspective to an RTS command view. The recorded rebuild demonstrates service bots and a spider construction bot working through a city infrastructure mission, with unit selection, movement orders, and repair tasks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras/aec10fe99fd74a6b3c476e677e344c8c.avif?t=1790799403\" alt=\"RTS command view of a spider construction bot climbing city infrastructure. Unity 6 gameplay captured before the September 2026 update; details may differ from the current build.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras_big/aec10fe99fd74a6b3c476e677e344c8c.avif?t=1790799403 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br><i>Images show the Unity 6 rebuild in development. INTERSTELLAR PRIME remains in Early Access; further missions, systems, and polish are still being worked on.</i><br><br><strong>Please base your purchase on the current Early Access content, not on future promises.</strong><br>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUMANITY'S FUTURE WAS BUILT BY MACHINES.</h2><br>INTERSTELLAR PRIME is a science-fiction RPG in Early Access. Enter Remnant City as Silas Lane, a Robocor technician whose work draws him into a conspiracy surrounding artificial intelligence and humanity's future.<br><br>Humanity's largest Martian colony survives inside the shattered remains of Phobos and Deimos. Automated systems keep the city alive, but the society that depends on them is beginning to lose control.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE UNITY 6 STORY REBUILD IS NOW IN EARLY ACCESS</h2><br>The public Steam build has been updated to the Unity 6 Story Mode rebuild. Begin the rebuilt story, explore Remnant City, and experience spacecraft and robot-command sequences. This is an incomplete Early Access build, with bugs, rough edges, and unfinished content.<br><br><strong>Development continues. The current release is an early portion of the game, not the completed campaign.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LOOK AT THE UNITY 6 REBUILD</h2><br>The Unity 6 rebuild brings third-person exploration, spacecraft sequences, and RTS robot command into the same adventure. These screenshots were captured from development gameplay shortly before the September 2026 update. Details may differ from the current build, and visuals, interfaces, controls, performance, and content remain in development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras/5a7bf9394a109abf2ba431324f775885.avif?t=1790799403\" alt=\"Third-person exploration through the neon-lit streets of Remnant City. Unity 6 gameplay captured before the September 2026 update; details may differ from the current build.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/644000/extras_big/5a7bf9394a109abf2ba431324f775885.avif?t=1790799403 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WALK THE STREETS 