                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So this game is a single guy work. which makes It an allright game. not that bad and there have clearly been put a lot of work into it.\nBUT. even for that this needs alot of work. \n\n--\nWalking and movement is clunky at best\nCombat is bad.\nChar - Lifeless and clunky lots of bugs\nlighting needs improvement\nVoice acting`? needs to be better\n\n---BUT\nother then that so far, there is hope for this game, prehabs in a year or two it could be good.\nright now it just seems like a money grabber, imma keep the game to see how it grows but atm i would not play it again.\n\nBut in the future ill bet my money on its gonna be great :D",
